apeiron.machine.infinite_me_output_assembly.desc=Combined Item and Fluid Output for Multiblocks\nOne ME connection accepts both items and fluids\nUnlimited item/fluid buffers with exact counts and transactions\nIndependent item/fluid buffers and storage-cell slots\nItem cell in the first row; fluid cell in the second row\nSupports partition filters, caching and priority\nRight click with wire cutter to change ME connections\nRight click with screwdriver to toggle both cache modes
