apeiron.machine.me_output.item_settings=Item output settings
apeiron.machine.boundless_me_output_bus.desc=Item Output for Multiblocks\nStores directly into ME\nUnlimited buffer; no capacity setting required\nExact arbitrary-precision counts and output transactions\nInsert a storage cell for partition filters and cache mode\nRight click with wire cutter to change ME connections\nRight click with screwdriver to toggle Cache Mode
apeiron.machine.boundless_me_output_hatch.desc=Fluid Output for Multiblocks\nStores directly into ME\nUnlimited buffer; no capacity setting required\nExact arbitrary-precision counts and output transactions\nInsert a fluid storage cell for partition filters and cache mode\nRight click with wire cutter to change ME connections\nRight click with screwdriver to toggle Cache Mode
