gt.blockmachines.apeiron.infinite_pattern_input_mirror.name=Infinite Pattern Input Assembly Mirror
apeiron.machine.infinite_pattern_input.desc=Item and fluid pattern inputs for multiblocks\n360 scrolling pattern slots\n24 isolated buffers with 32 item and 32 fluid types each\nUnlimited exact counts in every buffer slot\nMultipliers are stored in this block; pattern items stay unchanged\nRight-side button switches patterns and multipliers\nBottom-right button opens buffered contents\nPlus opens shared catalysts; middle-click a pattern for its catalysts\nSupports Programmable Hatches programming circuits\nLeft click with a data stick, then right click the mirror to link\nUse wire cutter to change ME connections
apeiron.machine.infinite_pattern_mirror.desc=Shares the linked Infinite Pattern Input Assembly\nNo copied inventory or additional AE channel\nLeft click the source with a data stick, then right click the mirror\nRight click to view the source patterns and buffered contents\nThe link persists through saves and dropped items\nPauses while the source is unloaded; never forces chunk loading
