apeiron.machine.infinite_storage_input_bus.desc=Reads and consumes items directly from the ME network\n360 scrolling selection slots\nAutomatic and manual selections with a configurable refresh interval\nCombine item mod ID, item ID, damage and ore dictionary filters\nFluid filters use registry names, independently of item damage and ore names\nExact minimum amounts accept 1E18 and 1e18\nCounts are not limited to int or long\nSelections are phantom; only recipe consumption extracts resources\nWire cutter changes connections; data sticks copy configurations
apeiron.machine.infinite_storage_input_hatch.desc=Reads and consumes fluids directly from the ME network\n360 scrolling selection slots\nAutomatic and manual selections with a configurable refresh interval\nCombine item mod ID, item ID, damage and ore dictionary filters\nFluid filters use registry names, independently of item damage and ore names\nExact minimum amounts accept 1E18 and 1e18\nCounts are not limited to int or long\nSelections are phantom; only recipe consumption extracts resources\nWire cutter changes connections; data sticks copy configurations
apeiron.machine.infinite_storage_input_assembly.desc=Reads and consumes items and fluids directly from the ME network\n360 scrolling selection slots\nAutomatic and manual selections with a configurable refresh interval\nCombine item mod ID, item ID, damage and ore dictionary filters\nFluid filters use registry names, independently of item damage and ore names\nExact minimum amounts accept 1E18 and 1e18\nCounts are not limited to int or long\nSelections are phantom; only recipe consumption extracts resources\nWire cutter changes connections; data sticks copy configurations
